5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! Let's figure this out so we're all happy. I want to make sure we don't end up freezing or stressed later! I'm curious about how other people handle this.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We need a sustainable system. I think it's important to look at the actual data first to avoid any surprises during the winter months.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to know how we can make this super easy! If it's too hard, we'll just get confused. Let's find a way that doesn't take forever to figure out every month!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's keep it rational. We should stop guessing and look at the actual numbers to see if the current split is actually fair or if some of us are just subsidizing others.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree that we need a rational approach. However, we should also consider how the payment process affects our atmosphere. Let's look at the facts and the history of how we've handled this.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'm with you, Rin! It should be simple. I'll check the ""Monthly settle observed at another house"" and ""Sunlight and heating need by room"" to see how we can stay cozy and fair!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll look into ""The last twelve utility statements"" and the ""Electrician's quote for the rooms."" I want to understand the annual fluctuations and any potential costs for changing our current setup.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I'll check the ""Trial run of a reconciliation template"" and the ""Payment log for the last twelve months""! I want to see if there's a shortcut to make the math way faster for everyone!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll take ""Plug-in monitor readings room by room"" and ""The last twelve utility statements."" If we're going to talk about fairness, I want the hard data on who is actually using what.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I will look into the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and ""Settling up when the last rooms filled."" I want to see how the transition and the actual payment history have played out.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I think we've got a good variety of things covered! I'm really hoping we can find a way that doesn't make anyone feel guilty for wanting to be warm. What do you guys think?,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"It is a good start. By combining the historical statements with the electrician's quote, we can determine if a structural change is more cost-effective than simply adjusting the monthly split.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I hope the template is like a magic trick that does all the work for us! If we can just plug in numbers and be done, that would be the best!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Magic tricks are for children, Rin. I'm more interested in whether the ""magic"" is just hiding the fact that some of us are paying for others' luxury. Let's see what the data actually says.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shunichi, data is important, but the way we communicate that data matters too. I hope we can find a solution that is fair without creating unnecessary tension between us.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I totally agree with Misaki! Let's keep it friendly. I'm excited to see what we find out! I'll be waiting to hear everyone's reports so we can make a great plan together!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Let's remain objective. Once we have the information, we can compare the costs and the usage patterns to find a logical solution. I look forward to seeing the results.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to find the fastest way to do this so we can spend more time playing and less time doing boring math! See you all soon!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be waiting. Just don't be surprised if the ""boring math"" reveals some uncomfortable truths. I prefer a cold truth over a warm, fuzzy lie any day. See you all in the next round.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I hope we can all be honest with each other. Let's use the information we find to build a system that is both fair and sustainable for our relationship. See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
